# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files, regardless of the
# checking-out platform's core.autocrlf setting (an explicit `eol` here
# takes precedence over core.autocrlf). This eliminates the CRLF/LF
# working-tree churn seen repeatedly on Windows checkouts during this
# project's development, where `git status` would flag files as modified
# even though `git diff` showed zero real content differences.
* text=auto eol=lf
